Consequently, **`conf reserved` stays green**, as do the other rows, although reserved bit 2 would now be retained. The omitted cell is **partial mask widening**: PRETABLE names kept, narrowed and dropped masks.

Another one-character survivor is changing TB_ENA�?Ts assignment from `=` to `|=`. Its only inputs are `0x80` and `0x81`; both normalize to `0x80`. **`tbena stored` remains green**, although clearing TEN stops working. Even silently declining the `0x81` write passes because the preceding value is already `0x80`.

