S1. THE DEFECT.  `DEVICE_ACCESS(lca_ioc)` had six write arms of the shape `d->x = idata; if (idata !=
    K) { fatal(...); exit(1); }` -- the value STORED, then the process ended.  Accepted sets, enumerated
