17:| `IOC_W_BASE0` | `0x3fff00000ULL` | **Accept and store** the defined base, SG and WEN fields. Preserve existing readback; remove the magic-value whitelist. |
19:| `IOC_W_BASE1` | `0x3fff00000ULL` | **Accept and store**, as for base 0. In particular, zero must work: initialization explicitly requires it. |
